{"id":"5f19d760d9e98dce","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-quotient-homomorphism-factorization.md","title":"常于同余类的同态唯一下降","display":"thm-quotient-homomorphism-factorization — 常于同余类的同态唯一下降","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-quotient-homomorphism-factorization","aliases":["56-thm-quotient-homomorphism-factorization"],"display":"thm-quotient-homomorphism-factorization — 常于同余类的同态唯一下降","depends_on":["[[56-thm-quotient-algebra-well-defined]]","[[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]"],"source_section":"7.1.9; 7.2.1(i)","source_pages":"263; 266","source_ocr_blocks":[284,287],"source_statement_status":"local-factorization-corollary-from-source-definitions","source_proof_status":"local-graph-construction-and-uniqueness-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-quotient-homomorphism-factorization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-quotient-homomorphism-factorization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-quotient-homomorphism-factorization — 常于同余类的同态唯一下降"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ee77de74c708cdc0\" href=\"?note=ee77de74c708cdc0\" title=\"56-thm-quotient-algebra-well-defined\">56-thm-quotient-algebra-well-defined</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f75e1125f61f318\" href=\"?note=4f75e1125f61f318\" title=\"56-df-sigma-homomorphism\">56-df-sigma-homomorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"7.1.9; 7.2.1(i)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"263; 266"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>284</span><span>287</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"local-factorization-corollary-from-source-definitions"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-graph-construction-and-uniqueness-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)\">\\(\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(B,J)\">\\(\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(B,J)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)\">\\(\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A/Q,I_Q)\">\\((A/Q,I_Q)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a]_Q\">\\([a]_Q\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_Q\">\\(q_Q\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ee77de74c708cdc0\" href=\"?note=ee77de74c708cdc0\" title=\"56-thm-quotient-algebra-well-defined\">56-thm-quotient-algebra-well-defined</a>。假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,a&#39;\\in A\\;((a,a&#39;)\\in Q\\Rightarrow h(a)=h(a&#39;))\">\\(\\forall a,a&#39;\\in A\\;((a,a&#39;)\\in Q\\Rightarrow h(a)=h(a&#39;))\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists!\\bar h\\in B^{A/Q}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A/Q,I_Q,B,J,\\bar h)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\bar h([a]_Q)=h(a))\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists!\\bar h\\in B^{A/Q}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A/Q,I_Q,B,J,\\bar h)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\bar h([a]_Q)=h(a))\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Definitions 7.1.9、7.2.1(i) 的本地推论，用于展开初始模型证明，并非原书单独编号定理。图{([a]Q,h(a)):a∈A}由类上常值条件单值且全；同态性由商运算式及h的同态性得到。投影满射使因子函数在每个类上的值都被固定，因此唯一。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003，7.1.9; 7.2.1(i)，印刷页 263; 266。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 为本地DjVu文字层页块序号，不是物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-thm-quotient-algebra-well-defined","status":"resolved","id":"ee77de74c708cdc0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-quotient-algebra-well-defined]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-sigma-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"4f75e1125f61f318","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-quotient-algebra-well-defined","status":"resolved","id":"ee77de74c708cdc0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$、$\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(B,J)$、$\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)$，且 $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)$。$(A/Q,I_Q)$、$[a]_Q$、$q_Q$ 见 [[56-thm-quotient-algebra-well-defined]]。假设 $\\forall a,a'\\in A\\;((a,a')\\in Q\\Rightarrow h(a)=h(a'))$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(B,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)","display":false},{"tex":"(A/Q,I_Q)","display":false},{"tex":"[a]_Q","display":false},{"tex":"q_Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a,a'\\in A\\;((a,a')\\in Q\\Rightarrow h(a)=h(a'))","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists!\\bar h\\in B^{A/Q}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A/Q,I_Q,B,J,\\bar h)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\bar h([a]_Q)=h(a))\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1709,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-256",